WEBVTT

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:06.589
A brand new homepage layout where you can see
all your projects in a couple columns,

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:09.676
or click here to see them
laid out on one page.

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:13.179
On a project, click the star
and it moves straight to the top.

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:17.225
Click this little drop to switch up
your Basecamp background color.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:19.227
Nice.

00:00:19.227 --> 00:00:22.147
A new menu at the bottom of your screen
where you can instantly

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:26.192
check out your tasks, upcoming events,
anything that's happening today,

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:29.237
bookmarked pages,
and a section called My Notes

00:00:29.237 --> 00:00:32.741
where you can quickly jot
something down or keep a file handy.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:35.201
Then over here,
you can see the last five things

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:39.080
that happened in your account and who's
been active over the last 24 hours.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:41.916
Hold the shift button to see keyboard
shortcuts.

00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:45.003
Then, while holding shift, press
one of these to get right to it.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.672
Let's do shift S to open the new sidebar.

00:00:47.672 --> 00:00:50.258
Now here's
where you can check out notifications

00:00:50.258 --> 00:00:53.344
then knock them out one by one
without switching screens.

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.929
Just super nice.

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:57.474
You can bubble up notifications
that you can't get to

00:00:57.474 --> 00:00:59.309
right now, but want to check out later.

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:01.728
When the time comes,
they're going to show up here.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.521
Then just hit pop to clear it out.

00:01:04.522 --> 00:01:04.939
You can

00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:07.942
filter through notifications
to find that thing you missed.

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:12.781
Read and send pings from the sidebar
without losing your place in Basecamp,

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:17.160
or open a ping in full screen,
then open another one in the sidebar

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:20.747
so you can have a conversation with
one person and check in with someone else.

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.373
And this one is a big request.

00:01:22.373 --> 00:01:23.374
In pings and chats,

00:01:23.374 --> 00:01:27.629
you can now combine text with images
and review them before hitting send.

00:01:28.004 --> 00:01:29.339
Pretty important.

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:32.467
Record voice notes to quickly
get an idea out of your head.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:37.263
Click the Basecamp menu
to navigate to anywhere from anywhere.

00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:39.390
You can jump to these pages, type

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:43.228
something in, go to recently visited
or click a project.

00:01:43.228 --> 00:01:45.105
And if you have multiple Basecamp
accounts,

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:49.192
you can type them in and jump right
to them or whatever project you want.

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:50.568
Let's check this one out.

00:01:50.568 --> 00:01:52.862
There's an updated project page
where you can now

00:01:52.862 --> 00:01:56.366
add a small image or quickly
rename the project.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:59.369
A simpler way to add people to projects

00:01:59.369 --> 00:02:02.372
and cut and dry notification settings.

00:02:02.372 --> 00:02:06.042
In the card table, you can now collapse
columns you don't need to see right now.

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:08.086
Then just open them back
up whenever you're ready.

00:02:09.754 --> 00:02:12.507
A new layout for docs and files
where you can take a quick peek

00:02:12.507 --> 00:02:16.010
at what's in a folder,
or just type something in to find it fast.

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:19.681
A new text editor that supports markdown.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:22.142
Copy a link,

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:26.062
highlight the text, then hit paste
and instantly get a hyperlink.

00:02:26.396 --> 00:02:28.857
And now you can add tables.

00:02:28.857 --> 00:02:30.775
That was another big request.

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:33.778
Add loose to-dos for random stuff
that doesn't have a list yet.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.948
Then drag it into one if it makes sense.

00:02:36.948 --> 00:02:40.118
Completed to-dos are grouped in hidden
so they're out of the way.

00:02:40.243 --> 00:02:42.912
Click them to see what's been checked off.

00:02:42.912 --> 00:02:46.791
You can now add subtasks into it
to-do for those tricky assignments

00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:49.794
that have multiple steps.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:53.965
A new activity feed where you can see
all activity across your account

00:02:53.965 --> 00:02:58.469
in a timeline, or click Wrap-up
to get a big picture view of each project.

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:02.015
And now Basecamp has a full blown
calendar.

00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:06.019
It's got a global calendar
with everything across all projects in it.

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:08.688
Circle important events so they stick out.

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:12.358
You can hover over a project name
to highlight its events and deadlines, or

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:16.154
assign colors to certain project calendars
so they're easy to identify.

00:03:16.404 --> 00:03:19.991
Filter by just you, everyone just events,

00:03:20.825 --> 00:03:23.369
events and tasks or type something in.

00:03:25.121 --> 00:03:27.123
We've got a new everything page

00:03:27.123 --> 00:03:30.210
that pulls together everything,
no matter which project it's in.

00:03:30.293 --> 00:03:33.922
So here you can look through all messages
across your entire Basecamp account.

00:03:33.922 --> 00:03:36.925
And there are filters
that help you quickly locate that thing.

00:03:36.925 --> 00:03:38.426
This one's really nice -
if you have something

00:03:38.426 --> 00:03:41.429
in the next 15 minutes, Basecamp
is going to remind you.

00:03:41.596 --> 00:03:44.098
As it gets closer,
the reminders turn green.

00:03:44.098 --> 00:03:46.017
Then just click the button to join
the call.

00:03:46.017 --> 00:03:48.186
We'll just be late to that one.

00:03:48.186 --> 00:03:51.189
And now we've got much simpler
project creation.

00:03:51.439 --> 00:03:53.650
Just create a name,

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:55.568
then add tools as you go.

00:03:55.568 --> 00:03:58.571
When you add external links to other apps,

00:03:59.489 --> 00:04:02.033
they show up in their own section
at the bottom.

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:05.662
And you can rename tools just by clicking
them, then typing in whatever you want.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:10.083
Then hover over a tool to instantly
get going with or remove it.

00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:13.169
And last everything you can do
on your computer,

00:04:13.169 --> 00:04:15.088
you can also do on your phone.

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:17.423
Okay, so that one isn't new,
but it's nice to pick up

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:19.926
where you left off from anywhere.
And that's it for now.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:26.641
Find out how straightforward
it is for yourself.
